  "description": "Brief non-blocking floating notification confirming completed actions or transient feedback.\n\nVariants & Properties:\n- Use: Neutral | Success | Warning | Danger.\n- Properties: 👁️ Icon, 👁️ Description, 👁️ Action, 👁️ Close, ✏️ Title, ✏️ Description.\n\nWhen not to use: Use Alert for persistent messages inside forms; use Dialog for mandatory decisions.",
